<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>LLM Internals</title><link>https://jaehun.me/tags/llm-internals/</link><description>딥러닝 컴파일러 엔지니어 류재훈의 기술 블로그. LLM 추론 최적화, KV 캐시, 컴파일러, C++와 AI 논문·오픈소스 코드 분석을 정리합니다.</description><language>ko-kr</language><atom:link href="https://jaehun.me/tags/llm-internals/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>[논문 리뷰] Attention Sinks and Compression Valleys in LLMs are Two Sides of the Same Coin</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-attention-sinks-and-compression-valleys-in-llms-are-two-sides-of-the-same-coin/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-attention-sinks-and-compression-valleys-in-llms-are-two-sides-of-the-same-coin/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 23 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.06477v1"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;논문 링크&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="massive-activations가-만든-하나의-서사-attention-sink-와-compression-valley-를-잇다"&gt;Massive Activations가 만든 하나의 서사: &lt;strong&gt;Attention Sink&lt;/strong&gt; 와 &lt;strong&gt;Compression Valley&lt;/strong&gt; 를 잇다&lt;a href="#massive-activations%ea%b0%80-%eb%a7%8c%eb%93%a0-%ed%95%98%eb%82%98%ec%9d%98-%ec%84%9c%ec%82%ac-attention-sink-%ec%99%80-compression-valley-%eb%a5%bc-%ec%9e%87%eb%8b%a4" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 id="tldr"&gt;TL;DR&lt;a href="#tldr" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;잔차 스트림의 massive activations(특히 BOS)&lt;/strong&gt; 가 &lt;strong&gt;지배적 특이값&lt;/strong&gt; 을 형성해 &lt;strong&gt;중간층 표현 압축(엔트로피↓)&lt;/strong&gt; 과 &lt;strong&gt;attention sink(주목이 BOS로 쏠림)&lt;/strong&gt; 을 &lt;strong&gt;동일 레이어에서 동시&lt;/strong&gt;로 유발하며, &lt;strong&gt;표적 MLP-ablation&lt;/strong&gt; 으로 이를 &lt;strong&gt;인과적으로 확인&lt;/strong&gt;한다. 생성·추론·임베딩의 &lt;strong&gt;최적 깊이&lt;/strong&gt; 를 하나의 &lt;strong&gt;Mix–Compress–Refine&lt;/strong&gt; 프레임으로 설명한다 (근거: §Abstract, §3.1–§3.3, Fig.1–4, §4–§5).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>